example:
actor Learner { auth = Bearer(secret = "AUTH_SECRET"), identity = UserId }                          // ✗ shares its secret with `Internal`, and says nothing of who a token is for
actor Internal { auth = Bearer(secret = "AUTH_SECRET"), identity = UserId }

actor Learner { auth = Bearer(secret = "AUTH_SECRET", audience = "api"), identity = UserId }          // ✓
actor Internal { auth = Bearer(secret = "AUTH_SECRET", audience = "internal"), identity = UserId }
